  "worked_solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Nz & =[\\begin{aligned}-8 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -6 & 5 \\\\ 4 & 2 & 7\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}(-8)\\cdot 3 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,1\\cdot (-4) & + & 2\\cdot 2 \\\\ 3\\cdot 3 & + & (-6)\\cdot (-4) & + & 5\\cdot 2 \\\\ 4\\cdot 3 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\cdot (-4) & + & 7\\cdot 2\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}-24 & + & (-4) & + & 4 \\\\ 9 & + & \\,\\,\\,24 & + & 10 \\\\ 12 & + & (-8) & + & 14\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-24 \\\\ 43 \\\\ 18\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
